# Ships (tools/land.sh), kit-sync ships and checks, fast-verify and rollbacks (src/host-job.ts BUILD_SLICE) run
# here, under citadel.slice, beside citadel-turns.slice instead of inside it (#1280). On 2026-11-20 a 2.25G land
# shared the turns' 10G MemoryHigh with 18 turns and the slice stalled for minutes (the Status page's Memory
# limits tile records these). Turns keep their 10G and builds get 10G of their own, so no one's memory shrinks;
# citadel.slice's MemoryMax stays the hard stop. No MemoryMax here on purpose: past it a land slows, never dies.
# Ultra reviews stay in the turns' slice. Not installed yet, the slice still works, with no limit of its own.
[Unit]
Description=Ships, checks and builds of Citadel

[Slice]
MemoryHigh=10G
